1
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,613
KAYLA: Your call is important to us.

2
00:00:08,213 --> 00:00:11,826
KAYLA: Did you know? FlexZone members who visit live longer.

3
00:00:12,826 --> 00:00:14,467
KAYLA: You have not visited.

4
00:00:15,167 --> 00:00:17,123
DALE: Yeah. I know, Kayla.

5
00:00:17,923 --> 00:00:21,039
KAYLA: To cancel your membership, say: cancel.

6
00:00:23,639 --> 00:00:24,339
DALE: Ca—

7
00:00:26,839 --> 00:00:30,394
ZETH: Dale Krupnik! Do NOT finish that word.

8
00:00:31,394 --> 00:00:32,685
DALE: I am on HOLD.

9
00:00:34,285 --> 00:00:38,580
DALE: Forty-seven minutes! If this call drops, I swear to God...

10
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:50,370
ZETH: I am Zeth, Prime Auditor of the Galactic Reserve. Nine trillion beings need you to keep that membership.

11
00:00:50,870 --> 00:00:53,913
DALE: It's thirty-five bucks a month. I don't even go.

12
00:00:54,513 --> 00:00:56,360
ZETH: No. You don't.

13
00:00:56,860 --> 00:01:05,752
QUIB: Eleven years, zero visits! But every Sunday night, you sincerely intend to start Monday. Five hundred and seventy-three Mondays in a row!

14
00:01:06,152 --> 00:01:07,262
DALE: I've been busy.

15
00:01:07,962 --> 00:01:18,410
ZETH: Every currency needs something that never changes. We tried gold. We tried the speed of light... which turned out to be negotiable. Then, we found you.

16
00:01:18,910 --> 00:01:25,848
QUIB: You're more stable than the proton! Protons decay eventually. You are never going to do anything!

17
00:01:26,348 --> 00:01:29,289
DALE: Okay, hey. I wrestled in high school.

18
00:01:29,639 --> 00:01:30,925
QUIB: You kept score.

19
00:01:31,375 --> 00:01:32,834
DALE: Which is PART of wrestling!

20
00:01:33,634 --> 00:01:39,273
ZETH: The pensions of forty thousand worlds, Mister Krupnik, are stored in your thighs.

21
00:01:42,973 --> 00:01:45,593
DALE: So... what's that worth to you?

22
00:01:46,093 --> 00:01:50,359
ZETH: Name it. A moon. A sun. Immortality.

23
00:01:54,459 --> 00:01:57,858
DALE: I want the good parking spot at work. The one by the door.

24
00:01:58,858 --> 00:02:00,254
ZETH: That... is all?

25
00:02:00,754 --> 00:02:02,887
DALE: And I want Greg to know I got it.

26
00:02:04,487 --> 00:02:06,024
QUIB: Greg... has been notified.

27
00:02:06,524 --> 00:02:07,411
DALE: Is he upset?

28
00:02:07,861 --> 00:02:09,281
QUIB: He's devastated.

29
00:02:10,081 --> 00:02:11,557
DALE: Then we've got a deal.

30
00:02:15,057 --> 00:02:21,966
BRAD: DALE! Brad, from FlexZone! Your free training session, mate! You booked it in twenty-fourteen, and tonight's the night!

31
00:02:22,566 --> 00:02:23,395
ZETH: Vex.

32
00:02:23,995 --> 00:02:24,695
BRAD: Zeth.

33
00:02:25,035 --> 00:02:26,728
BRAD: Still long on mediocrity?

34
00:02:27,228 --> 00:02:30,941
QUIB: He's a short seller! He's bet everything that you'll improve!

35
00:02:31,441 --> 00:02:32,801
DALE: Somebody bet on me?

36
00:02:33,301 --> 00:02:35,323
QUIB: It's considered very reckless.

37
00:02:36,123 --> 00:02:43,228
BRAD: Dale. Mate. I believe in you. One push-up. One push-up, and you're a whole new man.

38
00:02:43,628 --> 00:02:46,319
ZETH: One push-up, and the currency breaks.

39
00:02:48,419 --> 00:02:50,023
DALE: What do I get if I do it?

40
00:02:50,423 --> 00:02:55,319
BRAD: Abs. Self-respect. Your father's approval... retroactively.

41
00:02:56,019 --> 00:02:56,859
DALE: And if I don't?

42
00:03:01,759 --> 00:03:02,636
ZETH: Nachos.

43
00:03:03,736 --> 00:03:04,636
DALE: ...What kind?

44
00:03:05,086 --> 00:03:06,064
ZETH: What kind?!

45
00:03:06,364 --> 00:03:08,644
QUIB: Uh... the kind with everything!

46
00:03:11,144 --> 00:03:19,674
DALE: You think I don't know? I know I'm never going. I've known since twenty-fifteen. I pay thirty-five bucks a month so I don't have to say it out loud.

47
00:03:22,474 --> 00:03:26,187
ZETH: That is the most beautiful prospectus I have ever heard.

48
00:03:26,687 --> 00:03:29,258
QUIB: I'm putting my mom's savings in him.

49
00:03:30,158 --> 00:03:34,412
DALE: Well. Not tonight. Tonight, I'm doing one push-up.

50
00:03:34,712 --> 00:03:35,994
BRAD: YES, Dale!

51
00:03:41,594 --> 00:03:44,745
QUIB: He's going down! Andromeda just halted trading!

52
00:03:48,345 --> 00:03:51,814
DALE: Getting down here... is already cardio.

53
00:03:55,414 --> 00:03:58,446
BRAD: Down and up, Dale! Down and up!

54
00:03:59,046 --> 00:04:01,497
ZETH: Hold, sloth. Hold.

55
00:04:07,897 --> 00:04:10,010
KAYLA: Your call is important to us.

56
00:04:13,210 --> 00:04:15,761
DALE: Oh, hey. That's where the remote went.

57
00:04:18,161 --> 00:04:21,023
DALE: You know what? It's actually really nice down here.

58
00:04:22,423 --> 00:04:23,545
DALE: I'll start Monday.

59
00:04:26,045 --> 00:04:31,094
QUIB: The peg holds! He did nothing! He did nothing, for all of us!

60
00:04:31,594 --> 00:04:33,552
ZETH: Magnificent.

61
00:04:34,352 --> 00:04:38,535
BRAD: No. No, no, no! I'm leveraged forty to one on his glutes!

62
00:04:50,835 --> 00:04:53,467
SHARON: Dale. Did you cancel the gym?

63
00:04:54,367 --> 00:04:55,870
DALE: ...I'm gonna start going.

64
00:04:56,670 --> 00:05:01,019
SHARON: I swear, Dale. One more thing, and I'm leaving.

65
00:05:03,819 --> 00:05:07,024
QUIB: She's said that... four thousand times.

66
00:05:10,824 --> 00:05:13,628
ZETH: Open... a second fund.

67
00:05:22,748 --> 00:05:26,362
KAYLA: Did you know? FlexZone members who visit live longer.
